# N100 Financial Platform — Ratio Engine Edge Cases & Schema Alignment Log
# Date: 2026-09-22 | Status: Production Design Decision Log (Evidence-Based Policy)

====================================================================================================
1. BACKGROUND & DISCOVERY (DAY 8 - SEP 22, 2026)
====================================================================================================
During Sprint 2 Day 8 verification, an extreme OPM anomaly was discovered for AXISBANK (-10,277% to +13,857%).
A full forensic audit across all 92 companies and 1,073 P&L rows revealed two distinct source data export phenomena
originating from Screener.in's raw table exports:

A. BANKING & FINANCING P&L TEMPLATE (16 Companies):
   - Screener.in reports banking financials using specialized line items (Interest Earned, Interest Expended, 
     Financing Profit, Financing Margin %, Other Income, Provisions).
   - In the generic flat export schema `[sales, expenses, operating_profit, opm_percentage, other_income, interest, ...]`:
     * `sales`              = Total Revenue / Interest Earned (₹ Cr)
     * `expenses`           = Financing Cost / Interest Expended (₹ Cr)
     * `operating_profit`   = Operating Expenses (Staff + Admin) (₹ Cr)
     * `opm_percentage`     = Financing Profit in ₹ Crores (e.g., ₹-10,277 Cr for AXISBANK 2018)
     * `other_income`       = Financing Margin % (e.g., -22% for AXISBANK 2018)
     * `interest`           = Non-Interest / Other Income (₹ Cr)
     * `profit_before_tax`  = PBT (after deducting provisions)
     * `net_profit`         = True Net Profit (100% genuine)
     * `eps`                = True EPS (100% genuine)

B. SHIFTED NON-FINANCIALS (6 Companies: HINDUNILVR, CIPLA, COALINDIA, HINDALCO, HEROMOTOCO, INDIGO):
   - A known Screener scraping column-offset occurred for these 6 companies:
     * `sales`              = True Revenue (₹ Cr)
     * `expenses`           = Other Income (₹ Cr)
     * `operating_profit`   = True Operating Expenses (₹ Cr)
     * `opm_percentage`     = True Operating Profit (₹ Cr) [Identity: sales - operating_profit = opm_percentage]
     * `other_income`       = True OPM % (Integer percentage)
     * `depreciation`       = True Depreciation (₹ Cr)
     * `profit_before_tax`  = True PBT (₹ Cr)
     * `tax_percentage`     = True Tax %
     * `net_profit`         = True Net Profit (₹ Cr)
     * `eps`                = True EPS

C. CLEAN FINANCIALS (7 Companies: JIOFIN, IRFC, RECLTD, BAJAJFINSV, BAJAJHLDNG, LICI, SBILIFE):
   - These 7 Financials companies have 100% clean adherence to standard accounting: `sales - expenses == operating_profit`.
   - Their operating_profit is genuine operating profit.
   - OPM and ROCE are computed normally, with `roce_sector_relative = True` flagged for sector comparison.

D. STANDARD NON-FINANCIALS (63 Companies: TCS, RELIANCE, INFOSYS, MARUTI, TITAN, ABB, etc.):
   - 100% clean adherence to standard accounting: `sales - expenses == operating_profit`.

