C. FULL AUDIT SYNTHESIS & ARCHITECTURAL DECISION:
- Combined Unique Companies Logged Across ROCE & ROE: 32 companies
  * Data source issues: 6 companies (BEL, HAL, INDIGO, LT, PNB, TCS)
  * Version/timing differences: 6 companies (ADANIGREEN, ADANIPOWER, GODREJCP, TATAMOTORS, TATASTEEL, TRENT)
  * Formula discrepancies: 20 companies (ABB, ADANIENT, ASIANPAINT, BAJAJ-AUTO, BAJAJFINSV, BAJAJHLDNG, BOSCHLTD, BPCL, COALINDIA, DRREDDY, EICHERMOT, INFY, IRCTC, LICI, LTIM, M&M, MARUTI, NESTLEIND, PFC, SBILIFE)
- ARCHITECTURAL POLICY:
  All downstream analytics, screening filters, scoring engines, and dashboard cards MUST consume
  the computed values from `financial_ratios` table. The pre-computed columns in `companies.xlsx`
  (roce_percentage, roe_percentage) are strictly treated as auxiliary source metadata for cross-audit
  and display reference only, never as canonical inputs.
